bluejetty:00071548:ios.description:
Baby Panda's School Bus is a fun 3D car driving simulator with a variety of educational games specially designed for preschool children! In this game, kids can not only drive cool vehicles like race cars, school buses, police cars, and fire trucks, but also learn traffic rules and life skills in the exciting world of cars!
VARIOUS VEHICLES
In this preschool game, there are not only vehicles like school buses, police cars, fire trucks, food trucks, and construction vehicles, but also trains, airplanes, and other exciting modes of transportation! You can drive a school bus to pick up and drop off kids at preschool, take a tour bus to a farm town, drive a police car to clear up traffic in the parking lot, or race on a track with a race car. Even more vehicles will be added in future updates, bringing cool charm to your driving adventures. So stay tuned!
REALISTIC DRIVING EXPERIENCE 
This fun car game offers stunning 3D scenes to explore—from movie theaters and parks to towns, cities, snowy mountains, and deserts! Step into a realistic driver's cabin where you control everything: speed, direction, starting, and stopping. With lifelike traffic conditions, including moving vehicles and walking pedestrians, you’ll enjoy a truly immersive and authentic driving experience!
CREATIVE CAR DIY 
In this game, you can freely design your own car! From seats and steering wheels to tires and paint jobs, every detail is up to you! You can even add parts like wings or fishtails to give your car special abilities like flying or diving! Complete tasks in the driving simulator world to unlock a flying pet! It will become your loyal companion, joining you as you play, travel anywhere you like, and enjoy racing games along with many other fun mini-games! 
LEARN WHILE YOU PLAY
Baby Panda's School Bus is more than just a car driving simulator for kids. It's also an educational preschool learning game! Here, children can learn basic traffic rules. Before the school bus leaves the station, they'll make sure every passenger is wearing a seatbelt. They’ll stop at red lights, go on green, and yield to pedestrians at crosswalks. Through school bus driving simulations, children will develop essential traffic safety awareness while having a great time!
This 3D driving simulation game is suitable for all preschoolers, whether it's a 4-year-old girl who loves princess dress-up games or a 6-year-old boy who enjoys casual open-world games, everyone can find fun here! With a wide variety of vehicles and scenes to explore, children are free to use their imagination and creativity to write their own unique school bus adventure stories!
FEATURES: 
- For avid fans of school bus games, driving simulators, and open-world games;
- Many fun games to play: police games, cooking games, farm games, school games, and more;
- 8 kinds of vehicles for you to drive: airplane, school bus, tour bus, police car, construction truck, fire truck, train, and food truck;
- 30+ beautiful 3D scenes: home, supermarket, hospital, amusement park, parking lot, and more;
- 50+ fun tasks: taking pictures, coloring, puzzles, drawing, math, doll design, etc.;
- 5 kinds of festive events: Ramadan, Children's Day, Halloween, Christmas, and New Year;
- Learn 10+ types of preschool knowledge: recognize animals, identify colors, write numbers; learn math, art, and science;
- Play 8 roles: driver, farmer, cashier, doctor, teacher, architect, and more;
- Meet more than 10 friends;
- Support offline play!

